{"4167960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Jaden Williams' The Stalking Stairs", "steam_appid": 4167960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The city’s under curfew after a series of disappearances and murders. You’re a young delivery driver trying to finish your gig before 9:00 PM. Set inside a decaying apartment complex, every knock on a door brings you closer to uncovering what lurks within its halls, where every delivery could be your last. <i>The Stalking Stairs</i> is a <strong>PSX-style psychological horror thriller</strong> featuring tense atmosphere, immersive sound design, and full voice acting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Walking Simulator:</strong> Experience a grounded, first-person exploration loop. Walk the halls, interact with objects, and knock on doors to complete your deliveries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Dialogue System:</strong> Engage in conversations with the building's unique and unsettling residents using selectable dialogue options. Your interactions flesh out the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PSX-Style Atmosphere:</strong> Immerse yourself in a retro-aesthetic horror experience featuring low-poly models, jittery textures, and a hauntingly atmospheric sound design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative Mystery:</strong> Uncover the truth behind the recent disappearances through environmental storytelling and character interactions. Every delivery brings you closer to the truth of who the killer is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Comprehensive Settings Suite:</strong> The game features an advanced UI and menu system, allowing players to fully customize their audio, visual, and control settings to fit their specific needs.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The city’s under curfew after a series of disappearances and murders. You’re a young delivery driver trying to finish your gig before